        {
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:37281/scope.html",
          "visibility": "visible",
          "active": "<body>\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n  <header class=\"topbar\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"./index.html\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">S</span> ScopeSignal</a><span class=\"top-status\">Fixture mode · no live payments</span></header>\n  <main id=\"main\" class=\"workspace scope-workspace\">\n    <a class=\"scope-back\" href=\"./index.html#workspace\">← Back to the example fixture</a>\n    <div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">BRIEF → CHECKPOINTS → HUMAN REVIEW</p><h1>Shape the work.<br><em>Agree on the proof.</em></h1></div><span class=\"fixture-badge\">FICTIONAL PROJECT ONLY</span></div>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Build a scope, agree on what each milestone proves, and explore its payment lifecycle one decision at a time.</p>\n    <p class=\"scope-session-note\">This is a fictional workspace. Download a workspace file to keep your draft or simulation; refreshing otherwise clears it. Files stay on your device. No payment or AI service is called.</p>\n    <p class=\"scope-help\"><a href=\"./scope-compare.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Compare two saved workspaces</a> in a separate tab while keeping this workspace in place.</p>\n    <p class=\"scope-help\"><a href=\"./scope-csv.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Convert checkpoint CSV to a draft workspace</a> in a separate tab, then review and open the downloaded JSON here.</p>\n    <section class=\"scope-files\" aria-labelledby=\"scope-files-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"scope-files-title\">Keep this workspace</h2>\n      <p>Save your brief, evidence drafts and simulated history in one file. Opening a file shows a preview before replacing your current work.</p>\n      <div class=\"scope-file-controls\">\n        <button id=\"scope-save\" class=\"button button-outline\" type=\"button\">Download workspace</button>\n        <button id=\"scope-review-download\" class=\"button button-outline\" type=\"button\">Download scope review</button>\n        <button id=\"scope-revision-download\" class=\"button button-outline\" type=\"button\" aria-describedby=\"scope-revision-help\" disabled=\"\">Download revision draft</button>\n        <label class=\"scope-file-open\" for=\"scope-open\">Open saved workspace\n          <input id=\"scope-open\" type=\"file\" accept=\".json,application/json\" aria-describedby=\"scope-file-help\">\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <p id=\"scope-file-help\" class=\"microcopy\">Version 1 workspace JSON, up to 1 MiB. These unsigned files contain fictional records, not verified approvals or payment evidence.</p>\n      <p class=\"microcopy\">Scope review is a read-only HTML snapshot you can open offline and print, including unfinished fields or recorded review evidence. Keep the workspace JSON to resume editing.</p>\n      <p id=\"scope-revision-help\" class=\"microcopy\">After approval, download a revision draft to reuse the original scope terms. The copy has no approvals, payment events or review notes. Your current workspace stays open; reopen the copied JSON to edit and review it anew.</p>\n      <p id=\"scope-file-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Workspace download started. Keep the JSON file to reopen this fictional draft or simulation.</p>\n      <div id=\"scope-open-preview\" class=\"scope-open-preview\" hidden=\"\">\n        <h3>Ready to open</h3>\n        <p id=\"scope-open-summary\"></p>\n        <p>Replacing the workspace clears the current page's work. Download it first if you want to keep it.</p>\n        <button id=\"scope-open-apply\" class=\"button button-dark\" type=\"button\">Replace workspace</button>\n      </div>\n      <button id=\"scope-open-cancel\" class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" hidden=\"\">Cancel open</button>\n      <p id=\"scope-file-origin\" class=\"scope-session-note\">Opened from a saved fixture. All approvals and capture events shown are fictional records from an unsigned file.</p>\n    </section>\n    <ol class=\"scope-steps\" aria-label=\"Scope workflow\"><li id=\"draft-step\">1 · Draft the scope</li><li id=\"review-step\" aria-current=\"step\">2 · Review the evidence</li><li id=\"simulate-step\">3 · Simulate milestones</li></ol>\n\n    <form id=\"scope-form\" novalidate=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n      <div id=\"scope-errors\" class=\"scope-errors\" role=\"alert\" tabindex=\"-1\" hidden=\"\"></div>\n      <section class=\"panel\" aria-labelledby=\"scope-details-title\">\n        <div class=\"panel-heading\"><h2 id=\"scope-details-title\">The creative brief</h2><span>Editable draft</span></div>\n        <div class=\"scope-fields\">\n          <label for=\"scope-label\">Project name<input id=\"scope-label\" name=\"label\" maxlength=\"120\" required=\"\"></label>\n          <label for=\"scope-cap\">Project cap (USD)<input id=\"scope-cap\" name=\"cap\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-describedby=\"cap-help\" required=\"\"><small id=\"cap-help\">Checkpoint amounts may total less than the cap.</small></label>\n          <label class=\"scope-wide\" for=\"scope-brief\">Creative brief<textarea id=\"scope-brief\" name=\"brief\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"8000\" required=\"\"></textarea></label>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"panel\" aria-labelledby=\"draft-checkpoints-title\">\n        <div class=\"panel-heading\"><h2 id=\"draft-checkpoints-title\">Define the checkpoints</h2><span>1–12 milestones</span></div>\n        <p class=\"scope-help\">Give each milestone a clear deliverable, an amount, and evidence a person can review. Add, remove, revise, duplicate, and move checkpoints up or down before approval. Each checkpoint's fields move together. Duplicate checkpoint inserts an editable copy immediately after the original, preserving all three field values.</p>\n        <p id=\"scope-order-status\" class=\"scope-help\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p>\n        <div id=\"scope-draft-list\"><fieldset class=\"scope-row\" data-index=\"0\"><legend>Checkpoint 1</legend><div class=\"scope-fields\"><label for=\"draft-0-title\">Deliverable<input id=\"draft-0-title\" data-field=\"title\" required=\"\" maxlength=\"160\"></label><label for=\"draft-0-amount\">Milestone amount (USD)<input id=\"draft-0-amount\" data-field=\"amount\" required=\"\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><label class=\"scope-wide\" for=\"draft-0-evidence\">Planned acceptance evidence<textarea id=\"draft-0-evidence\" data-field=\"evidence\" required=\"\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"5000\"></textarea></label></div><div class=\"scope-draft-actions\"><button class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" data-move=\"up\" data-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Move checkpoint 1 up\" disabled=\"\">Move up</button><button class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" data-move=\"down\" data-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Move checkpoint 1 down\">Move down</button><button class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" data-duplicate=\"0\" aria-label=\"Duplicate checkpoint 1\">Duplicate checkpoint</button><button class=\"text-button scope-remove\" type=\"button\" data-remove=\"0\" aria-label=\"Remove checkpoint 1\">Remove checkpoint</button></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"scope-row\" data-index=\"1\"><legend>Checkpoint 2</legend><div class=\"scope-fields\"><label for=\"draft-1-title\">Deliverable<input id=\"draft-1-title\" data-field=\"title\" required=\"\" maxlength=\"160\"></label><label for=\"draft-1-amount\">Milestone amount (USD)<input id=\"draft-1-amount\" data-field=\"amount\" required=\"\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><label class=\"scope-wide\" for=\"draft-1-evidence\">Planned acceptance evidence<textarea id=\"draft-1-evidence\" data-field=\"evidence\" required=\"\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"5000\"></textarea></label></div><div class=\"scope-draft-actions\"><button class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" data-move=\"up\" data-index=\"1\" aria-label=\"Move checkpoint 2 up\">Move up</button><button class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" data-move=\"down\" data-index=\"1\" aria-label=\"Move checkpoint 2 down\" disabled=\"\">Move down</button><button class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" data-duplicate=\"1\" aria-label=\"Duplicate checkpoint 2\">Duplicate checkpoint</button><button class=\"text-button scope-remove\" type=\"button\" data-remove=\"1\" aria-label=\"Remove checkpoint 2\">Remove checkpoint</button></div></fieldset></div>\n        <button id=\"scope-add\" class=\"button button-outline\" type=\"button\">+ Add checkpoint</button>\n      </section>\n      <div class=\"scope-draft-footer\">\n        <p id=\"scope-budget\" class=\"scope-budget\" role=\"status\">$13.00 allocated · $0.00 unallocated within the cap</p>\n        <button class=\"button button-dark\" type=\"submit\">Review this scope <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"microcopy\">Reviewing the plan does not approve a checkpoint. Each acceptance below needs its own explicit human decision.</p>\n    </form>\n\n    <section id=\"scope-review\" aria-labelledby=\"review-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR FIXTURE SCOPE</p><h2 id=\"review-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">PEER quoted scope 🚤</h2></div><button id=\"scope-edit\" class=\"button button-outline\" type=\"button\">Edit draft</button></div>\n      <p id=\"review-brief\" class=\"brief\">Exact creative brief\nSecond line, kept</p>\n      <p id=\"scope-lock-note\" class=\"scope-help\">You can edit this plan until the first checkpoint is approved.</p>\n      <div class=\"summary-grid\" aria-label=\"Authored fixture totals\">\n        <article><span>PROJECT CAP</span><strong id=\"scope-total\">$13.00</strong></article>\n        <article><span>APPROVED</span><strong id=\"scope-approved\">0 / 2</strong></article>\n        <article><span>SIMULATED CAPTURED</span><strong id=\"scope-captured\">$0.00</strong></article>\n        <article><span>ALLOCATED REMAINING</span><strong id=\"scope-remaining\">$13.00</strong></article>\n      </div>\n      <p id=\"scope-unallocated\" class=\"scope-help\">$13.00 allocated to checkpoints. $0.00 of the project cap remains unallocated.</p>\n      <p id=\"scope-action-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Plan ready for review. No checkpoints are approved and no fixture payment events exist yet.</p>\n      <div id=\"scope-review-list\"><article class=\"scope-review-card\" data-checkpoint=\"scope-1\" aria-labelledby=\"review-heading-scope-1\"><span class=\"cp-state\">CHECKPOINT 1 · NEEDS REVIEW</span><div class=\"scope-review-heading\"><h3 id=\"review-heading-scope-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">PEER 🚤, \"alpha\" &lt;b&gt;literal&lt;/b&gt;</h3><strong>$12.30</strong></div><label for=\"review-evidence-scope-1\">Evidence for human review</label><textarea class=\"scope-evidence\" id=\"review-evidence-scope-1\" data-evidence=\"scope-1\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"5000\"></textarea><div class=\"scope-review-actions\"><button class=\"button button-dark\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"approve\" data-checkpoint=\"scope-1\">Approve this evidence</button></div><div class=\"scope-review-state\"><strong>Capture state: not started</strong><p>No capture has been requested for this checkpoint.</p></div></article><article class=\"scope-review-card\" data-checkpoint=\"scope-2\" aria-labelledby=\"review-heading-scope-2\"><span class=\"cp-state\">CHECKPOINT 2 · NEEDS REVIEW</span><div class=\"scope-review-heading\"><h3 id=\"review-heading-scope-2\" tabindex=\"-1\">=1+1</h3><strong>$0.70</strong></div><label for=\"review-evidence-scope-2\">Evidence for human review</label><textarea class=\"scope-evidence\" id=\"review-evidence-scope-2\" data-evidence=\"scope-2\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"5000\"></textarea><div class=\"scope-review-actions\"><button class=\"button button-dark\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"approve\" data-checkpoint=\"scope-2\">Approve this evidence</button></div><div class=\"scope-review-state\"><strong>Capture state: not started</strong><p>No capture has been requested for this checkpoint.</p></div></article></div>\n      <section class=\"ledger\" aria-labelledby=\"scope-ledger-title\">\n        <div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"scope-ledger-title\">Your fixture event ledger</h3><span id=\"scope-event-count\">0 events</span></div>\n        <p class=\"scope-help\">These are simulated events for this scope, not payment evidence. Lost responses remain unknown until you simulate a transaction lookup.</p>\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><caption class=\"sr-only\">Events recorded by explicit decisions in the authored fixture</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">#</th><th scope=\"col\">CHECKPOINT</th><th scope=\"col\">EVENT</th><th scope=\"col\">RESULT</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"scope-event-body\"></tbody></table></div>\n      </section>\n      <p class=\"scope-help\">Use Download revision draft above to keep the original terms for a new review. To return to the example instead, <a href=\"./scope.html\">start a fresh fixture</a>; this clears the current in-memory plan and events.</p>\n    </section>\n    <noscript><p class=\"scope-errors\">This interactive fixture needs JavaScript. The <a href=\"./index.html\">example page</a> describes the payment model.</p></noscript>\n  </main>\n  <footer><a class=\"brand\" href=\"./index.html\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">S</span> ScopeSignal</a><span>Fixture mode · no live money · no customer data</span></footer>\n\n\n</body>",
